### auth_lab.http — Authentication Gauntlet Lab
### Write your REST Client request blocks under each phase header.
### Run a block with Ctrl+Alt+R (Windows/Linux) or Cmd+Alt+R (macOS).
### Hint: all endpoints live under http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 1 — Basic Authentication
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TODO: Find the Basic Auth endpoint in api/urls.py.
# TODO: Write a GET request that sends credentials using the
#       Authorization: Basic <base64(username:password)> header.
#       Tip: REST Client supports  Authorization: Basic admin admin123  directly.

### Phase 1 — Synthesis Challenge: Attacker replay
# An attacker who intercepts "Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=" off an unencrypted
# connection can replay this exact header without ever knowing it decodes to
# admin:admin123. Base64 is reversible encoding, not encryption — the server
# just decodes and string-matches against the DB, so the encoded string IS
# the credential in practice. This is only safe over HTTPS.
### Phase 1 — Basic Auth (authenticated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/basic/
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=


### Phase 1 — Basic Auth (unauthenticated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/basic/ HTTP/1.1

###





### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 2 — Session Authentication
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This phase is done in the browser: log in at http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/
# (admin / admin123), then DevTools -> Application/Storage -> Cookies -> sessionid.
# REST Client/Postman don't share the browser's cookie jar, so a request with
# no cookie is rejected (403):

### Phase 2 — Session Auth (replaying a copied sessionid = session hijacking)
# Paste the sessionid value copied from the browser. The server only checks
# that this key exists in django_session, so whoever holds it is "admin".
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/session/ HTTP/1.1
Cookie: sessionid=<PASTE_SESSIONID_HERE>

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 3 — Token Authentication (Opaque)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Token 6d361a3d44e5e31dec9e6042c1ea995d907e9fc5



### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 4 — JSON Web Tokens (JWT)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Phase 4 — JWT Login (obtain tokens)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/login/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Phase 4 — JWT Protected Request (valid token — expect 200 OK)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMjAzNDYxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTAyMDE2NjEsImp0aSI6IjU1N2VkMDU0ZGI1NTQ0YjNhNWUyZTY0NWM0YTBjMDRjIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.kEiUZ8G1BlMPNBmgpFE38aaWaKamxiQMdVXlPykmw1g

### Phase 4 — Tampered JWT (user_id changed to "2" on jwt.io — expect 401 Unauthorized)
# Payload segment changed: ...IjoiMSJ9... (user_id=1) → ...IjoiMiJ9... (user_id=2)
# Signature segment is UNCHANGED — the server will reject it because the
# signature no longer matches the new payload.
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMjAzNDYxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTAyMDE2NjEsImp0aSI6IjU1N2VkMDU0ZGI1NTQ0YjNhNWUyZTY0NWM0YTBjMDRjIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjIifQ.kEiUZ8G1BlMPNBmgpFE38aaWaKamxiQMdVXlPykmw1g

### Phase 4 — Refresh Access Token (Bonus — expect 200 OK with new access token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/refresh/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refresh": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoicmVmcmVzaCIsImV4cCI6MTc5MDI4ODM1NywiaWF0IjoxNzkwMjAxOTU3LCJqdGkiOiI1MWU2MTkzZTU5MTg0M2FiOTI2MzkxNGMwNzJjNzg3MyIsInVzZXJfaWQiOiIxIn0._BFCZpiR0CtiPt2rdi6r4LmiTKAJrYKtlkDlZxbwc24"
}